      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14187307/assets/55a48d42cf89643b5fd965899e969bcee44216f7d13ee1812639720291f58e5a.png)\n\nThe tape diagram above shows the ratio between cheap and expensive soaps in a laundry. What is the ratio of cheap soaps to all soaps?",
