      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14187307/assets/fac768ca9a6b8bd086b6dd9e44f6b564845bad8cae8a3d1345332f25d5cc3f4c.png)\n\nThe tape diagram above shows the ratio between fiction and nonfiction books in a classroom library. What is the ratio of fiction books to all books?",
      "worked_solution": "The tape diagram for fiction books shows $5$ boxes while the tape diagram has $5+8=13$ boxes in total.\n\nTherefore, the ratio of fiction books to all books is $5:13.$",
