      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14187307/assets/146a01a45a5984dec5db93ede46ee67a84eb2a4ccc1d7e3abeafbcfd1f55a65b.png)\n\nThe tape diagram above shows the ratio between the number of Yes and No answers obtained in a survey of several kids about whether they liked the movie The Mega Titanium Man. What is the ratio of the number of Yes answers to  the total number of responses?",
      "worked_solution": "The tape diagram for Yes answers shows $6$ boxes while the tape diagram has $6+4=10$ boxes in total.\n\nTherefore, the ratio of Yes to all answers is $6:10.$",
