    "q-349298": {
      "dom_id": "step-q349298",
      "name": "Question 9",
      "problem": "In one minute, Ava can type $3$ words while Ben types $5$ words. Which tape diagram represents the given scenario?",
      "worked_solution": "We are told that:  \n\nIn one minute, Ava can type $3$ words while Ben types $5$ words.\n\nSo, in a tape diagram, Ava's tape must contain $3$ boxes, while the tape corresponding to Ben should have $5$ boxes.\n\nTherefore, the diagram is the following:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14187307/assets/315542297953311a7ebb8fe1ec63b6f896e0b06a526d49c0accac0837cfb9898.png)",
